        "slc_b6e9ddabbd2fee333802037bd6ed07a85366e243b0bbffb1e511009c203f6ae2"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture splits roles: the host runs tlbx and the user's tools, mthost runs terminals, mtagenthost runs Agent Controller sessions, and a browser client connects over HTTPS/WebSocket."
    },
    {
