        "slc_a5d7caed3a0b89d7ea45d81af1666847a69164e5c6d51a9e059ab0cfe27cba07"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions persist when the browser disconnects or the user switches devices, as long as the host stays awake and online; shutting down the host stops its processes."
    },
