        "slc_fbda5e13f4c36d98ab4cb1141e53ef4efd63ad12d5a49d1e8eda4c4512ecd538"
      ],
      "text": "The product supports PowerShell, bash and zsh plus full-screen terminal apps like btop, vim, lazygit and database shells, with sessions splittable into panes."
    },
