      "text": "Repository development practice: AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md instruct contributors that development happens on the dev branch, with main reserved for stable integration, and that release scripts (release-dev.ps1, promote.ps1, release.ps1) may only be run for the explicitly requested release path."
    },
