        "slc_d8b482e210981de83067f93b9532b7b85ec11f1097ae19b97eda18465f5445b2"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors are told to keep major data-processing, protocol and business logic in C# while keeping the TypeScript frontend lean, to remove superseded dead code in the same change, and to use domReconcile.ts for keyed UI lists so content-only updates preserve DOM node identity."
    }
